":"relu","etiquette":"atteste","fr":"现 est un composé idéo-phonétique : 王, la forme du jade 玉 en position de clé, donne le sens, et 见 donnait le son. Anciennement, 见 se lisait aussi xiàn au sens de « se montrer, apparaître », et 现 a été formé plus tard pour écrire ce sens à part. D'« apparaître » vient « présent, actuel », le sens de 现今 et de 现有.","en":"现 is a phono-semantic compound: 王, the form jade 玉 takes as a radical, carries the meaning, and 见 once carried the sound. In older texts, 见 could also be read xiàn, meaning “to show, to appear”, and 现 was created later to write that sense on its own. From “to appear” came “present, current”, the meaning found in 现今 and 现有.","roles":{"王":"sens","见":"forme"}}},"线":{"c":"线","pinyin":"xiàn","lectures":["xiàn"],"niveau":3,"decomposition":{"norme":"GF 0014-2009","parts":["纟","戋"],"sources":["cjk-decomp"]},"mots":["L3-0465","L3-0785","L5-0300","L5-0821","L5-1006","L6-0688","L6-0881","L7-0826","L7-0844","L7-0858","L7-2140","L7-3210","L7-3262","L7-3369","L7-3649","L7-3748","L7-4080","L7-4384","L7-4385","L7-4502","L7-4781","L7-4869","L7-5189"],"chemin":{"hsk":447,"lire":441},"sens":{"statut":"relu","glose":"fil ; ligne","acceptions":[{"categorie":"N","fr":"fil"},{"categorie":"N","fr":"ligne, trajet (bus, métro)"}]},"exemples":[{"zh":"我要坐几号线？","pinyin":"Wǒ yào zuò jǐ hào xiàn?","fr":"Quelle ligne je dois prendre ?","statut":"relu"}],"origine":null},"羡":{"c":"羡","pinyin":"xiàn","lectures":["xiàn"],"niveau":7,"decomposition":{"norme":"GF 0014-2009","parts":["羊","冫","欠"],"sources":["cjk-decomp"]},"mots":["L7-4507"],"chemin":{"hsk":1348,"lire":1341},"sens":{"statut":"relu","glose":"envier","acceptions":[{"categorie":"V","fr":"envier, admirer"}]},"exemples":[],"origine":null},"腺":{"c":"腺","pinyin":"xiàn","lectures":["xiàn"],"niveau":7,"decomposition":{"norme":"GF 0014-2009","parts":["月","白","水"],"sources":["cjk-decomp"]},"mots":["L7-4509"],"chemin":{"hsk":1349,"lire":1342},"sens":{"statut":"relu","glose":"glande","acceptions":[{"cat