: “each other”.","roles":{"木":"sens","目":"sens"}}},"箱":{"c":"箱","pinyin":"xiāng","lectures":["xiāng"],"niveau":3,"decomposition":{"norme":"GF 0014-2009","parts":["⺮","木","目"],"sources":["cjk-decomp"]},"mots":["L3-0858","L4-0048","L4-0799","L4-0800","L5-0850","L7-1676","L7-1899"],"chemin":{"hsk":448,"lire":442},"sens":{"statut":"relu","glose":"caisse, malle ; classif. des caisses","acceptions":[{"categorie":"N","fr":"caisse, malle, boîte"},{"categorie":"M","fr":"classificateur des caisses, des cartons"}]},"exemples":[{"zh":"我买了一箱水。","pinyin":"Wǒ mǎi le yī xiāng shuǐ.","fr":"J'ai acheté un pack d'eau.","statut":"relu"}],"origine":null},"镶":{"c":"镶","pinyin":"xiāng","lectures":["xiāng"],"niveau":7,"decomposition":{"norme":"GF 0014-2009","parts":["钅","衣","口","口","𠀎"],"sources":["cjk-decomp"]},"mots":["L7-4533","L7-4534"],"chemin":{"hsk":1350,"lire":1343},"sens":{"statut":"relu","glose":"incruster, sertir","acceptions":[{"categorie":"V","fr":"incruster, sertir, border"}]},"exemples":[{"zh":"这扇门上镶着玻璃。","pinyin":"Zhè shàn mén shang xiāng zhe bōli.","fr":"Cette porte a un panneau vitré.","statut":"relu"}],"origine":null},"香":{"c":"香","pinyin":"xiāng","lectures":["xiāng"],"niveau":3,"decomposition":{"norme":"GF 0014-2009","parts":["禾","日"],"sources":["cjk-decomp"]},"mots":["L3-0791","L3-0792","L5-0827","L7-2434","L7-4528","L7-4529","L7-4530","L7-4531","L7-4532"],"chemin":{"hsk":448,"lire":441},"sens":{"statut":"relu","glose":"parfumé, qui sent bon ; savoureux","acceptions":[{"categorie":"Adj","fr":"parfumé, qui sent bon"},{"categorie":"Adj","fr":"savoureux, appétissant"},{"categorie":"N","fr":"encens"}]},"exemples":[{"zh":"这花真香。","pinyin":"Zhè huā zhēn xiāng.","fr":"Ces fleurs embaument.","statut":"relu"},{"zh":"饭菜好香啊！","pinyin":"Fàncài hǎo xiāng a!","fr":"Ça a l'air délicieux !","statut":"relu"}],"origine":null},"祥":{"c":"祥","pinyin":"xiáng","lectures":["xiáng"],"niveau":6,"decomposition":{"norme":"GF 0014-2009","parts":["礻","羊"],"sources":["cjk-decomp"]},"mots":["L6-0411","L7-0622","L7-1878","L7-4536"],"chemin":{"hsk":865,"lire":858},"sens":{"statut":"relu","glose":"faste, propice","acceptions":[{"categorie":"Adj","fr":"faste, propice, heureux"}]},"exemples":[],"origine":null},"翔":{"c":"翔","pinyin":"xiáng","lectures":["xiáng"],"niveau":7,"decomposition":{"norme":"GF 0014-2009","parts":["羊","习","习"],"sources":["cjk-decomp"]},"mots":["L7-1093"],"chemin":{"hsk":1350,"lire":1343},"sens":{"statut":"relu","glose":"planer, voler","acceptions":[{"categorie":"V","fr":"planer, voler"}]},"exemples":[],"origine":null},"详":{"c":"详","pinyin":"xiáng","lectures":["xiáng"],"niveau":5,"decomposition":{"norme":"GF 0014-2009","parts":["讠","羊"],"sources":["cjk-decomp"]},"mots":["L5-0828","L7-1009","L7-4535"],"chemin":{"hsk":729,"lire":722},"sens":{"statut":"relu","glose":"détaillé ; expliquer en détail","acceptions":[{"categorie":"Adj","fr":"détaillé, minutieux"},{"categorie":"V","fr":"expliquer en détail"}]},"exemples":[{"zh":"详情请看网站。","pinyin":"Xiángqíng qǐng kàn wǎngzhàn.","fr":"Pour plus de détails, consultez le site.","statut":"relu"}],"origine":null},"享":{"c":"享","pinyin":"xiǎng","lectures":["xiǎng"],"niveau":5,"decomposition":{"norme":"GF 0014-2009","parts":["亠","口","子"],"sources":["cjk-decomp"]},"mots":["L5-0242","L5-0286","L5-0829","L7-4537","L7-4538"],"chemin":{"hsk":730,"lire":723},"sens":{"statut":"relu","glose":"jouir de, profiter de","acceptions":[{"categorie":"V","fr":"jouir de, profiter de, bénéficier de"}]},"exemples":[{"zh":"他退休后在家享福。","pinyin":"Tā tuìxiū hòu zài jiā xiǎngfú.","fr":"Retraité, il coule des jours heureux chez lui.","statut":"relu"}],"origine":null},"响":{"c":"响","pinyin":"xiǎng","lectures":["xiǎng"],"niveau":2,"decomposition":{"norme":"GF 0014-2009","parts":["口","向"],"sources":["cjk-decomp"]},"mots":["L2-0595","L2-0679","L6-0264","L6-0883","L7-2050","L7-4539","L7-4540","L7-4541","L7-4981"],"chemin":{"hsk":318,"lire":317},"sens":{"statut":"relu","glose":"sonore, bruyant ; sonner","acceptions":[{"categorie":"Adj","fr":"sonore, bruyant"},{"categorie":"V","fr":"sonner, retentir"}]},"exemples":[{"zh":"电话响了。","pinyin":"Diànhuà xiǎng le.","fr":"Le téléphone sonne.","statut":"relu"},{"zh":"声音太响了。","pinyin":"Shēngyīn tài xiǎng le.","fr":"Le son est trop fort.","statut":"relu"}],"origine":{"statut":"relu","etiquette":"atteste","fr":"Le Shuowen jiezi écrit 響 et le glose « son » : 音, le son, et 鄉 pour le son. La forme simplifiée prend 口, la bouche, et 向. 向 se lit xiàng, la même syllabe que 响, xiǎng.","en":"The Shuowen jiezi writes 響 and glosses it as “sound”: 音, sound, and 鄉 for the pronunciation. The simplified form takes 口, the mouth, and 向. 向 is read xiàng, the same syllable as 响, xiǎng.","roles":{"口":"sens","向":"son"}}},"想":{"c":"想","pinyin":"xiǎng","lectures":["xiǎng"],"niveau":1,"decomposition":{"norme":"GF 0014-2009","parts":["木","目","心"],"sources":["cjk-decomp"]},"mots":["L1-0400","L2-0348","L2-0596","L2-0597","L2-0598","L3-0687","L4-0506","L4-0511","L4-0801","L4-0802","L5-0261","L5-0473","L5-0656","L6-0391","L6-0884","L6-0966","L7-0312","L7-1398","L7-1702","L7-1798","L7-2390","L7-2410","L7-2972","L7-3914","L7-4272","L7-4542","L7-4611","L7-4670","L7-4960","L7-5536"],"chemin":{"hsk":121,"lire":115},"sens":{"statut":"relu","glose":"penser, vouloir, regretter l'absent","acceptions":[]},"exemples":[{"zh":"我想去中国。","pinyin":"Wǒ xiǎng qù Zhōngguó.","fr":"J'aimerais aller en Chine.","statut":"relu"},{"zh":"我很想你。","pinyin":"Wǒ hěn xiǎng nǐ.","fr":"Tu me manques beaucoup.","statut":"relu"}],"origine":{"statut":"relu","etiquette":"atteste","fr":"想 associe 心, le cœur, siège de la pensée, à 相, qui donne un son proche (xiāng). La norme découpe 相 en 木 et 目, l'arbre et l'œil. Le Shuowen jiezi le glose par « penser en espérant », d'où « penser », « vouloir » et « regretter l'absent ».","en":"想 combines 心, the heart, seat of thought, with 相, which gives a similar sound (xiāng). The standard splits 相 into 木 and 目, tree and eye. The Shuowen jiezi glosses it as “thinking with hope”, hence “to think”, “to want” and “to miss someone”.","roles":{"木":"son","目":"son","心":"sens"}}},"像":{"c":"像","pinyin":"xiàng","lectures":["xiàng"],"niveau":2,"decomposition":{"norme":"GF 0014-2009","parts":["亻","象"],"sources":["cjk-decomp"]},"mots":["L2-0220","L2-0601","L5-0537","L5-0661","L5-0662","L6-0559","L6-0973","L7-0257","L7-4175","L7-4547","L7-4548","L7-4576","L7-5019"],"chemin":{"hsk":319,"lire":317},"sens":{"statut":"relu","glose":"ressembler ; comme ; portrait","acceptions":[{"categorie":"V","fr":"ressembler à"},{"categorie":"Prep","fr":"comme, tel que"},{"categorie":"N","fr":"portrait, image, statue"}]},"exemples":[{"zh":"你很像你妈妈。","pinyin":"Nǐ hěn xiàng nǐ māma.","fr":"Tu ressembles beaucoup à ta mère.","statut":"relu"}],"origine":{"statut":"relu","etiquette":"atteste","fr":"Le Shuowen jiezi glose 像 par « ressemblance » : l'homme, 亻, et 象, qui donne aussi le son. 象 se lit xiàng, exactement comme 像. L'image d'une personne : le portrait, et « ressembler à ».","en":"The Shuowen jiezi glosses 像 as “likeness”: a person, 亻, and 象, which also gives the sound. 象 is read xiàng, exactly like 像. The image of a person: a portrait, and “to resemble”.","roles":{"亻":"sens","象":"son"}}},"向":{"c":"向","pinyin":"xiàng","lectures":["xiàng"],"niveau":2,"decomposition":{"norme":"GF 0014-2009","parts":[],"sources":[]},"mots":["L2-0161","L2-0599","L5-0830","L5-0831","L5-0832","L5-0895","L5-1050","L6-0579","L6-0661","L7-0773","L7-0897","L7-0922","L7-1068","L7-1652","L7-2694","L7-2985","L7-3115","L7-3387","L7-3849","L7-4543","L7-4544","L7-4545","L7-4621","L7-4974","L7-5379"],"chemin":{"hsk":228,"lire":237},"sens":{"statut":"relu","glose":"vers, en direction de","acceptions":[{"categorie":"Prep","fr":"vers, en direction de ; à (quelqu'un)"},{"categorie":"V","fr":"être tourné vers, faire face à"}]},"exemples":[{"zh":"向前走。","pinyin":"Xiàng qián zǒu.","fr":"Allez tout droit.","statut":"relu"}],"origine":{"statut":"relu","etiquette":"atteste","fr":"Le Shuowen jiezi glose 向 par « fenêtre tournée vers le nord » : 宀, la maison, et 口, l'ouverture. On voit toujours le toit et l'ouverture dessous. La fenêtre regarde dans une direction : « vers, faire face à ».","en":"The Shuowen jiezi glosses 向 as “a north-facing window”: 宀, the house, and 口, the opening. You can still see the roof and the opening below it. A window looks in one direction: “towards, to face”.","roles":{}}},"巷":{"c":"巷","pinyin":"xiàng","lectures":["xiàng","hàng"],"niveau":7,"decomposition":{"norme":"GF 0014-2009","parts":["龷","八","巳"],"sources":["cjk-decomp"]},"mots":["L7-0700"],"chemin":{"hsk":1351,"lire":1344},"sens":{"statut":"relu","glose":"ruelle","acceptions":[{"categorie":"N","fr":"ruelle"}]},"exemples":[],"origine":null},"橡":{"c":"橡","pinyin":"xiàng","lectures":["xiàng"],"niveau":7,"decomposition":{"norme":"GF 0014-2009","parts":["木","象"],"sources":["cjk-decomp"]},"mots":["L7-4549","L7-4550"],"chemin":{"hsk":1351,"lire":1344},"sens":{"statut":"relu","glose":"chêne ; hévéa","acceptions":[{"categorie":"N","fr":"chêne ; hévéa (arbre à caoutchouc)"}]},"exemples":[],"origine":null},"象":{"c":"象","pinyin":"xiàng","lectures":["xiàng"],"niveau":3,"decomposition":{"norme":"GF 0014-2009","parts":[],"sources":[]},"mots":["L3-0169","L3-0784","L3-0806","L3-0845","L4-0802","L5-0167","L5-0410","L5-0578","L5-0834","L7-0512","L7-1920","L7-2972"],"chemin":{"hsk":296,"lire":300},"sens":{"statut":"relu","glose":"éléphant ; image, apparence","acceptions":[{"categorie":"N","fr":"éléphant"},{"categorie":"N","fr":"image, apparence, phénomène"}]},"exemples":[],"origine":null},"项":{"c":"项","pinyin":"xiàng","lectures":["xiàng"],"niveau":4,"decomposition":{"norme":"GF 0014-2009","parts":["工","页"],"sources":["cjk-decomp"]},"mots":["L4-0803","L4-0804","L7-2036","L7-2471","L7-3283","L7-3737","L7-4546","L7-4721"],"chemin":{"hsk":585,"lire":578},"sens":{"statut":"relu","glose":"classificateur (tâches, points) ; nuque","acceptions":[{"categorie":"M","fr":"classificateur des tâches, articles, épreuves"},{"categorie":"N","fr":"nuque"}]},"